# Studio API

## Launch

```bash
email-assistant ui
```

Default: `http://127.0.0.1:8080`

## Structure

- `app/web/app.py` — FastAPI routes
- `app/web/jobs.py` — in-memory scrape/apply jobs
- `app/web/static/` — SPA frontend

## Key endpoints

- `/api/status` — auth and backend status
- `/api/domains`, `/api/contacts` — catalog CRUD
- `/api/team` — team config
- `/api/clients` — config.json client search
- Job endpoints for scrape and apply

## Rules

- Keep localhost binding as default.
- Do not expose tokens in API responses.
- Coordinate catalog changes with `catalog_store.py` patterns.
